            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "What is Gangnam Style AI?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Gangnam Style AI turns still portraits into a short AI-generated trio video inspired by the street-selfie trend. Choose friends, one selfie or pets as your starting point. It is not a recreation of the original music video."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Can I use only one photo?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Yes. Choose Three of you to use the same selfie for all three roles."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Can I generate a Gangnam Style AI pet video?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Choose Pet trio and upload three individual pet photos. Results and identity fidelity vary."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Does my video include the original song?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "New videos include the same soundtrack as the Gangnam Style trio reference clip shown on this page. The audio is added to the finished MP4, so you can preview and download it with sound."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "What aspect ratio and resolutions are available?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "This template uses fixed 16:9 landscape framing to preserve the trio scene. Choose 480p or 720p output quality."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "How long is a Gangnam Style AI video?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "The template is approximately 15 seconds; the final MP4 duration may vary slightly. Rendering time varies. Open My videos to check progress and download the completed file before its provider link expires."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Is there a subscription?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Use your existing MigosAI credits. One-time credit packs and subscriptions are available on the MigosAI pricing page. The generator shows the cost before submission."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "Will the faces look exactly like the photos?"
                ]
              },
              {
                "tag": "p",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "AI results are unpredictable. Identity, anatomy and movement can vary; exact likeness is not guaranteed."
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "details",
            "attrs": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "tag": "summary",
                "attrs": {},
                "children": [
                  "What happens if generation fails?"
